# bruiser-late: items axis: keep the treasure/jungle/power split before round 500, then put all gold into Bruiser Strength shards (one stacked stat, so 5 shards complete an emblem quickly), as the top teams do.
# coord-claim: a lone champion walks to a camp group an ally already claims (claimed_by_allies, intersected with goals), and every champion claims its goal so the team gathers on one group.

