# tune-roles: version 1 plus per-champion roles.
# HUNTER (Vendetta, Heart of Ruin): acts first in turn order and dives enemies in range.
# GUARD (Vesper Vale, Ren, Tavi): buys the altar lock on spawn, then parks next to a safe altar
#   with an empty bag and places the lock (place_altar_lock) to block enemy tributes.
# FARMERS (everyone else): the v1 camp, tribute and monolith routes.
# Lock state stays in shared byte 7: bit 0 = placed, bit 1 = bought.
# MOBILITY: carriers dash toward the open safe altar (fuel-gated) instead of only walking, to cut time exposed with gems.
# BANK-ON-PASS: a carrier banks at any altar it stands next to, and retreats to a safe altar before fighting with 10+ gems.
# Plan: gems are lost to the killer on death, so convert them early. (1) Tribute at any unlocked altar
# we pass with gems, not only with 25+. (2) A carrier with 10+ gems never dives and retreats to a safe
# altar when hurt with an enemy near. (3) Keep the altar-lock and monolith routes unchanged.
# v-kite: a ranged champion with a melee enemy adjacent steps away (move_away_from) before its fight-block attacks.

