# items-roles [items line]: per-champion shopping roles instead of one 4-way split that rarely completes an emblem
# (5 identical shards combine). Vendetta (carry): every shard into Treasure/Strength, so its emblem completes fast.
# Tavi (frontline/jungler): every shard into Jungle/Health, so it can tank camps and engagements.
# Ability casters (both slots damage/aoe/stun): Power/Focus, since focus scales ability damage.
# Everyone else keeps the old mixed split. Everything else unchanged from tune-v20-L1c.
# tune-v20-L1c [tune line]: v20 + lock once. One buy per team (bit 1 of shared byte 7 = bought, set with the buy), one
# placement (bit 0 = placed); placement fuel-gated > 60000. Bits 2-7 of byte 7 stay free (hybrid).
# line: tune
# disengage: back off before the first exchange when local_strength(5) < 1 (no enemy in reach yet); the opener needs local_strength(5) >= 1.
# Plan: (1) never open a fight we are losing on local numbers; (2) when an enemy is within 5 but none can hit us yet, step away;
# (3) once an exchange has started, keep the existing focus-fire so we do not take free hits while fleeing; (4) recalls
# and dashes stay gated on no enemy in reach; (5) ability openers only with local_strength(5) >= 1, so burst is saved for winnable fights.
# roles-escort [roles line]: Vendetta and Vesper Vale farm as carries; Tavi and Ryth (stunners) are escorts early (round < ESCORT_END): with an empty bag and nothing in reach, they walk to the nearest visible ally (a carry first) instead of farming alone, so we arrive together.
# vision-wards [vision line]: ward the bush beside the camp we head for (within 2 of us, on approach), and pull back to allies when 2+ enemies were seen lately but are now hidden.
# PLAN (vision axis): (1) ward bushes next to camp goals before we walk in, so the camp fight is seen first; (2) remember hidden enemies via unseen_enemies_near and fall back toward allies instead of walking into the fog;
# (3) keep the existing ward on a bush we stand on when nothing is visible; (4) all ward placements fuel-gated; (5) combat and tribute logic untouched.

# zg14: ability-type-aware casting from hybrid #14 (Opus): shield/heal on self, dash kept for escape/travel
def cast_on(slot, u):
    if ability_ready(slot):
        if slot_is_shield(slot) or slot_is_heal(slot):
            cast_self(slot)
        elif not slot_is_dash(slot):
            cast_at_unit(slot, u)

def dash_to(slot, t):
    if ability_ready(slot):
        if slot_is_dash(slot):
            dash_towards(slot, t)

